Check if Azure cli installed on machine:

az version

If not installed:

Install Azure CLI using PowerShell:

winget install --exact --id Microsoft.AzureCLI

check the version:

az version

az Installation can impact ArgoCD runnning server and app so validate we are good:

Confirm Argo CD server is healthy:
kubectl get pods -n argocd -l app.kubernetes.io/name=argocd-server
Start a new tunnel:

kubectl port-forward service/argocd-server `
  -n argocd `
  8443:443 `
  --address 127.0.0.1
Open:

https://127.0.0.1:8443

